WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
Select Power on to enter Johnpaul’s portfolio.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.080
Choose Start exploring to reach the desktop.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:10.560
Double-click Projects on the desktop.

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:16.040
Choose Personal to find Plan0 and Johnpaul’s other independent projects.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.600
Open Blog for Johnpaul’s articles on Medium.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.920
Use the arrows to browse articles. Read article on Medium opens the full post.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.680
Open MyGPT to ask about Johnpaul’s work, education or projects.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:31.600
The Education prompt asks where he studied. The answer comes from his public profile.

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.200
On a phone, tap an icon or swipe up to open the app drawer.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:40.320
Search for Blog, tap to open it, then use Home to return to the launcher.
